# Pre-rename runtime state. A machine that ran the watcher before the
# clearbot->autopilot rename still produces these, and renaming the ignore
# rules alone let `git add -A` commit them as tracked files (caught in a
# post-merge review of f223191, which did exactly that).
watcher/clearbot.stop
watcher/clearbot.heartbeat
